        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners O'Brien Swaine are delighted to bring this 0.5-acre site, S.T.P.P., SITE B, situated in the scenic rural area of Killincooley Beg to the market. Offering an excellent opportunity for those looking to build a home in a peaceful countryside setting.\n\nThe site has been cleared and is ready for development, with electricity and water available on site. It is conveniently located close to both Tinabearna Beach and Morriscastle Beach, providing easy access to some of the area?s beautiful coastal amenities.\n\nThe property is located close to the local beaches and amenities.\n\nPlease note: Local planning restrictions apply, including the relevant local housing/planning requirements for the area. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves regarding their eligibility and obtain planning advice before proceeding.\n\nViewing and further information available on request."
